    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_title">mahoya ma bluetooth</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_why">android nĩguo kũmenya akawanda rĩrĩa gũthaaga rĩĩmenya ũrĩa gũthaaga rĩĩkũmenya, rĩĩreke ylih ĩmenya mahoya mamo nĩmabathani mahoya ma gũthaaga, ĩmenya mahoya amwe ma mahoya.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_with">rĩrĩa ĩrĩ: mahoya o wothe nĩmagĩkinyithia rĩrĩa mahoya makinyaga, gũtaari na akawanda ĩrĩa ĩĩkaaga, na kĩndũ kĩ gũciiha.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_without">rĩrĩa ĩtarĩ: mahoya ma bluetooth nĩmakoonya kinyithia. gũthaaga riria kĩndũ kĩmwe nĩkĩĩkaaga, nĩ ũmenyaga reke kĩndũ ũndũ rũa gũthaaga rĩa ũrũngarũ.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_title">ũmenyĩtho</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_why">ũrũngarũ rũa gũthaaga rũkaaga gũthaaga gĩkĩruta, android nĩguo kũmenya akawanda o wothe yoigaga ĩrĩ na ũmenyĩtho o rĩrĩa rũguo rũĩruta.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_with">rĩrĩa ĩrĩ: ũmenyĩtho nĩguo kumenya ĩrĩa ĩrathuuraga rĩu rĩambĩrĩmbaga, nĩ ũmenyĩtho rũa ũrũngarũ rũa gũthaaga rũĩruta.</string>
